&_nc_oc=AdrV8QpJOXch6JPWILYMgKVmIyTfej2uOenIzQZCpPU8QEKzTNaVq25nqFLpfzHhukE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af728hRCel9fAFgpy4mBTrCvJZ6UerO1Q_d6t-ZHqG9Pmw&oe=6A0495BE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-VPLxjfZ8h4Q7kNvwFKJn5h&_nc_oc=Adr_PRltueLtk4ZoB3UzFJ-FNOz6l_uCEN0Ycol4Pp6IopK2Tnpcb0xsFgOoxTKfhEY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7G3Ro3j7AFpb2b32vOJUammKdykOkggd8M7kZiaTMfNw&oe=6A046E7C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K2rLsuNMcbIQ7kNvwGJlWMi&_nc_oc=Adoa1_4b3FrC8dSuR8k5Yaq_gPvCp9s4yNUEZ-N3gvN-OSxlIQL5sF8xHj9-UUCatEo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6A91KN4tXA7m-IR7OJlPG4g_t211QKxCMvjC2o8qNfpw&oe=6A048D07"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1q6rp2MizlQQ7kNvwFa1nZe&_nc_oc=AdqdZd4QX5H04GKwN_uyReDaiOTYphoSIDPwqHJkxgwEMkLZDcYaCPiVfQQOFIheYYE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4z8ruXlAK8Qwvi36PQAfCJfNXGVAHgqnNKIJdjk91sMQ&oe=6A0478D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AOv7VCgp57kQ7kNvwEMzNy6&_nc_oc=AdojohTRneC1znknxe8p5UNZUwk1cYb03UuJdEj2S8jTSDcekj_g_zWbB4cbBcBfwCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5DH1k1W8ViOiJEaPP0WV8U97xwknEd2H7YXIYOQiXYSw&oe=6A048564"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.